{"ref":"BDB, מַחֲלָה","hw":"מַחֲלָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מַחֲלָה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. sickness, disease</strong>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחֲלָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 15:26\" href=\"/Exodus.15.26\">Ex 15:26</a> + 3 times—<em>sickness, disease</em> (in gen.) <a data-ref=\"Exodus 23:25\" href=\"/Exodus.23.25\">Ex 23:25</a> (JE); so c. <span dir=\"rtl\">כל</span>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 8:37\" href=\"/I_Kings.8.37\">1 K 8:37</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 6:28\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.6.28\">2 Ch 6:28</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">כל־נֶגַע</span>), <a data-ref=\"Exodus 15:26\" href=\"/Exodus.15.26\">Ex 15:26</a> (JE; cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">אני יהוה רֹפְאֶ֑ךָ</span> <em>ad</em> fin.)","next":"BDB, מַחֲלוּי","prev":"BDB, מַחֲלֶה"}